OL,3,GNEWSAManx Care waits 'not good enough',
OL,4,Asays minister                          
OL,6,FThe health minister has described Manx 
OL,7,FCare's waiting times and finances as   
OL,8,F"simply not good enough".              
OL,10,FThe assessment of Manx Care by the     
OL,11,FDepartment of Health and Social Care   
OL,12,F(DHSC) found in 2025/26 cancer waiting 
OL,13,Ftime standards were missed and the     
OL,14,Fhealth service ended the year with a   
OL,15,F#14.9m deficit.                        
OL,17,FHowever, it also found that there had  
OL,18,Fbeen "meaningful progress" in community
OL,19,Fcare, with more supported at home      
OL,20,Frather than in hospital.               
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
