OL,3,GNEWSAManx Care waits 'not good enough',
OL,4,Asays minister                          
OL,6,FNewly elected Health and Social Care   
OL,7,FMinister Claire Christian MHK said:    
OL,8,F"It's important to remember that this  
OL,9,Fassessment looks back at last year, and
OL,10,Fwork is already under way to address   
OL,11,Fthese issues."                         
